  "body": "Deadline Sale Closes: 4:00 p.m. Wednesday 25th November 2026 (unless sold prior).\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a home of this calibre in such a tightly held location are exceptionally rare. While the property itself speaks to luxury without compromise, the message from our vendors is simple: our instructions are clear — this property must be sold. Buyers are encouraged to act with urgency and seize the opportunity to secure one of Takapuna's finest residences.\r\n\r\nOccupying a prized position on one of Takapuna's most prestigious coastal streets, 15 Ewen Street presents an extraordinary opportunity to secure a residence of exceptional scale, quality, and architectural distinction. Combining timeless Mediterranean elegance with contemporary luxury, this remarkable home delivers an unrivalled lifestyle just moments from the golden sands of Takapuna Beach.\r\nSet on 612sqm (more or less) of premium seaside land, the residence spans an impressive 509sqm (more or less) of internal living, complemented by approximately 83sqm of sun-soaked terraces designed to embrace the property's sought-after coastal setting. From the moment you arrive, the striking Travertine stone and stainless steel façade creates an unforgettable first impression, hinting at the calibre of craftsmanship found throughout.\r\n\r\nInside, expansive light-filled interiors unfold across three luxurious levels. Carrara marble flooring, underfloor heating, thermal triple glazing, and carefully curated finishes create a home that is both sophisticated and supremely comfortable. At its heart, the designer Gaggenau kitchen anchors the open-plan living and dining spaces, seamlessly connecting to outdoor entertaining areas and providing the perfect setting for both everyday family living and grand-scale hosting.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtful floorplan offers outstanding versatility, featuring five generous bedrooms, four beautifully appointed bathrooms, multiple living areas, and a private steam sauna. Whether accommodating extended family, working from home, or entertaining guests, the home's scale and design cater effortlessly to modern lifestyles.\r\n\r\nOutside, Mediterranean-inspired gardens frame a fully fenced and level backyard, creating a private sanctuary where children can play, guests can gather, and owners can relax in complete privacy. The low-maintenance grounds enhance the property's lock-up-and-leave appeal without compromising on space or enjoyment.\r\n\r\nLocated within one of Auckland's most desirable coastal communities, you're just moments from Takapuna Beach, top-performing schools, boutique shopping, renowned cafés and restaurants, and convenient motorway access to the CBD.\r\n\r\nInstructions are clear; this property must be sold.",
